		<a href="/pub/11-627-m/11-627-m2025057-eng.pdf" title="Infographic: Business conditions in Canada, fourth quarter of 2025 - PDF" class="btn btn-default btn-xs"><span class="glyphicon glyphicon-download-alt mrgn-rght-sm" title="PDF version: Business conditions in Canada, fourth quarter of 2025"></span>PDF version</a>
