<div class="clearfix"></div>
  <div class="alert alert-correction mrgn-tp-sm">
 <h2 id="correction-notice">Correction Notice</h2>
 <p>On March 18, 2026, the survey weights applied across all Canadian Survey on Business Conditions tables for the fourth quarter of 2025 were corrected. Revisions were made to this infographic accordingly. Data points were revised in all sections, with revisions ranging from 0.1 to 0.6 percentage points.</p>
</div>


  <!--<sup id="n1-refa"><a class="fn-lnk" href="#n1"><span class="wb-inv">Note </span>1</a></sup>-->
  <!-- ========== CONTENT GOES HERE ========== -->
	<div>
		<figure> <img src="/pub/11-627-m/2025057/11-627-m2025057-eng.png" class="img-responsive brdr-all" alt="Infographic: Business conditions in Canada, fourth quarter of 2025"/>
            <figcaption class="mrgn-tp-md">
                <details>
                <summary>Description: Business conditions in Canada, fourth quarter of 2025</summary>
                    <!-- Content Begins -->
                    <div>
                        <br>
                        <div class="table-responsive">
  <table class="table table-bordered table-condensed">
    <caption>Top obstacles expected by businesses over the next 3 months
      <span class="wb-inv">
		Table summary<br />This table displays the results of Top obstacles expected by businesses over the next 3 months , calculated using  (appearing as column headers).</span>
    </caption>
    <thead class="styx">
      <tr>
        <td class="rw-hd">&nbsp;</td>
        <th id="h_8_1-2">Percent</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_8_2-1">Inflation</th>
        <td headers="s_8_2-1 h_8_1-2">41.3%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_8_3-1">Cost of insurance</th>
        <td headers="s_8_3-1 h_8_1-2">26.4%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_8_4-1">Cost of inputs</th>
        <td headers="s_8_4-1 h_8_1-2">26.1%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_8_5-1">Recruiting skilled employees</th>
        <td headers="s_8_5-1 h_8_1-2">26.1%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_8_6-1">Fluctuations in consumer demand </th>
        <td headers="s_8_6-1 h_8_1-2">23.4%</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
						
						<div class="table-responsive">
  <table class="table table-bordered table-condensed">
    <caption>Labour-related obstacles businesses expect over the next three months 
      <span class="wb-inv">
		Table summary<br />This table displays the results of Labour-related obstacles businesses expect over the next three months , calculated using  (appearing as column headers).</span>
    </caption>
    <thead class="styx">
      <tr>
        <td class="rw-hd">&nbsp;</td>
        <th id="h_497_1-2">Percentage of businesses</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_497_2-1">Recruiting skilled employees</th>
        <td headers="s_497_2-1 h_497_1-2">26.1%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_497_3-1">Retaining skilled employees</th>
        <td headers="s_497_3-1 h_497_1-2">18.6%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_497_4-1">Shortage of labour force</th>
        <td headers="s_497_4-1 h_497_1-2">16.6%</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
						
						<div class="table-responsive">
  <table class="table table-bordered table-condensed">
    <caption>Nearly two-thirds of businesses are optimistic about the next 12 months
      <span class="wb-inv">
		Table summary<br />This table displays the results of Nearly two-thirds of businesses are optimistic about the next 12 months , calculated using  (appearing as column headers).</span>
    </caption>
    <thead class="styx">
      <tr>
        <td class="rw-hd">&nbsp;</td>
        <th id="h_401_1-2">Percentage of businesses</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_401_2-1">Very optimistic</th>
        <td headers="s_401_2-1 h_401_1-2">20.5%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_401_3-1">Somewhat optimistic</th>
        <td headers="s_401_3-1 h_401_1-2">45.3%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_401_4-1">Somewhat pessimistic</th>
        <td headers="s_401_4-1 h_401_1-2">17.2%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_401_5-1">Very pessimistic</th>
        <td headers="s_401_5-1 h_401_1-2">4.8%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_401_6-1">Don’t know</th>
        <td headers="s_401_6-1 h_401_1-2">12.2%</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
						
						<div class="table-responsive">
  <table class="table table-bordered table-condensed">
    <caption>Nearly two-fifths of businesses expect to increase their average wages over the next 12 months
      <span class="wb-inv">
		Table summary<br />This table displays the results of Nearly two-fifths of businesses expect to increase their average wages over the next 12 months , calculated using  (appearing as column headers).</span>
    </caption>
    <thead class="styx">
      <tr>
        <td class="rw-hd">&nbsp;</td>
        <th id="h_143_1-2">Percentage of businesses</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_143_2-1">Higher wages</th>
        <td headers="s_143_2-1 h_143_1-2">39.0%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_143_3-1">Similar wages</th>
        <td headers="s_143_3-1 h_143_1-2">44.0%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_143_4-1">Lower wages</th>
        <td headers="s_143_4-1 h_143_1-2">5.6%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_143_5-1">Don’t know</th>
        <td headers="s_143_5-1 h_143_1-2">11.3%</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
						
						<div class="table-responsive">
  <table class="table table-bordered table-condensed">
    <caption>Over one-third of businesses reported that interest rates had a medium or high impact on their business over the last 12 months
      <span class="wb-inv">
		Table summary<br />This table displays the results of Over one-third of businesses reported that interest rates had a medium or high impact on their business over the last 12 months , calculated using  (appearing as column headers).</span>
    </caption>
    <thead class="styx">
      <tr>
        <td class="rw-hd">&nbsp;</td>
        <th id="h_937_1-2">Percentage of businesses</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_937_2-1">High impact</th>
        <td headers="s_937_2-1 h_937_1-2">14.8%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_937_3-1">Medium impact</th>
        <td headers="s_937_3-1 h_937_1-2">22.5%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_937_4-1">Low impact</th>
        <td headers="s_937_4-1 h_937_1-2">25.0%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_937_5-1">No impact</th>
        <td headers="s_937_5-1 h_937_1-2">23.8%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="hghlght-rw">
        <th class="rw-s" id="s_937_6-1">Unsure of impact</th>
        <td headers="s_937_6-1 h_937_1-2">13.9%</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>
						
						<p><strong>Source:</strong> Statistics Canada, Canadian Survey on Business Conditions, fourth quarter of 2025.</p>
                        
